title: "Pusula: The First Full-Featured Turkish Decision Model"
abstract: >-
  Pusula is a Turkish decision model family: Pusula (a Turkish-trained LoRA adapter on vllm-sr/d3) and Pusula Nano
  (a TabiBERT cross-encoder).
